nts  yeah that's true that's what just blows  me away and i look at the children who  i think will remember their father and  that he had  no underlying conditions that's what's  so scary about kovid  had no underlying conditions whatsoever  none two weeks before the vaccine came  out he was going to get it  yeah he was arrested that's interesting  yeah he was gonna get it he was going to  get it yeah well she and she sums it up  right at the end  we have the answer let's use it in fact  she said he wanted to have a press  conference from his hospital bed  really to let people know his  constituents know  how real the virus was my heart aches  for her because you can really feel her  pain but you also see her strength  and her commitment now into helping  others that was really really a  beautiful story  congresswoman thank you for sharing your  story thank you
 

